<Placemark>
<name>SITE A — Lazimpat / Panipokhari</name>
<description>Benchmark site | Score 77.5/100 | Exact user-provided Apple Maps pin | Current benchmark property/pin. Strong premium wellness catchment, but direct Pilates competition is concentrated nearby.</description>
<styleUrl>#benchmark</styleUrl>
<Point><coordinates>85.32113,27.72278,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>Baluwatar</name>
<description>Candidate area | Score 80.5/100 | Representative neighborhood center | Premium residential and diplomatic catchment close to Lazimpat, with potential to capture similar customers outside the densest competitor cluster.</description>
<styleUrl>#top</styleUrl>
<Point><coordinates>85.328578,27.729122,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>Maharajgunj</name>
<description>Candidate area | Score 79.5/100 | Representative center near TUTH/Maharajgunj | Affluent residential demand plus major hospital/clinic activity. Strong fit for mobility, posture and controlled-strength positioning.</description>
<styleUrl>#strong</styleUrl>
<Point><coordinates>85.3304,27.736,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark>
<name>New Baneshwor</name>
